## 8. Schema Changes Summary (delta only — do not touch anything else in the original `.claude` §2)

| Table | Change |
|---|---|
| `aim.Users` | `PasswordHash` must be **nullable** (already implied for migrated users with no password); add `PasswordChangedAtUtc DATETIME2 NULL`. |
| `aim.PasswordHistory` | **New table**, per §7. |
| *(Redis, not SQL)* | New key families: `ubis:otp:{purpose}:{userId}`, `ubis:pwdsetup:{userId}`. |

---

## 9. New Audit Events (extend `aim.SecurityEvents`, no schema change needed — just new `EventType` values)

`OtpRequested`, `OtpVerified`, `OtpVerificationFailed`, `OtpAttemptsExceeded`, `PasswordSetupCompleted`, `PasswordResetCompleted`, `PasswordReuseRejected`.

---

## 10. Endpoint Summary (new surface added to `AIM.WebApi`)

```
POST /api/auth/login                        (existing — now returns mfaRequired challenge instead of a token)
POST /api/auth/login/verify-otp             (new)
POST /api/auth/login/resend-otp             (new)
POST /api/auth/password-setup/request       (new — first-time users, PasswordHash is null)
POST /api/auth/password-setup/verify-otp    (new)
POST /api/auth/password-setup/complete      (new)
POST /api/auth/password-reset/request       (new — existing users, "Forgot Password")
POST /api/auth/password-reset/verify-otp    (new)
POST /api/auth/password-reset/complete      (new)
```

